Changes: selected the artist's diffuse regional court-area curves, sampled them into polygons, approximately georegistered them using city markers, and added dated context metadata and diffuse rendering. The map is schematic and does not establish exact frontiers. The original SVGs are retained in references/gupta-sixth-century/.
